    "title": "MICROSERVICE_PROD_Open Banking AISP Products API",
    "description": "The Open Banking AISP Products API enables financial institutions to access and retrieve a list of available financial products. This API serves as a vital resource for account information service providers (AISPs) looking to provide consumers with insights on various financial offerings. Typical consumers of this API include fintech companies, banks, and third-party financial service providers. By leveraging this API, businesses can enhance their product comparison tools and make informed recommendations to users.",
